    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe77b172c47aa544858e1b11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但后来决定在那之前也要参加“安田纪念”。\n两场比赛间隔很短，按照常理不可能做到。\n只是如果想使出特大魔法，就必须颠覆常理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "030b35ef261b56e8a9753e892d0120e392099dbd5b22d3c138016e0c025405b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8497ba090cb624a79ee00d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "伊丽莎白女王杯结束后・决定了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03790e7f2c8b8390c7576881db47b6d973d59992d4c8f3e2fedc280b0e5ba2da",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044426.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80326de0b187d8fe87c6414c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革以精彩的表现，\n让“安田纪念”的观众们为之疯狂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a9fa458afc76da1703483d96e1e419856daf8481378831459fd656bf7fc90e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdbf52c368a7f55405723b7f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正在训练的荒漠英雄也听到了这个传闻，\n令她燃起斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e40ae0a9bb196dea729ee6cc296d8081e14a49218c395aa138e0b41a13db9f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1dddfa86578d3a9ec6ff65b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是完成咒语的魔女？还是觉醒的英雄？\n两人将在“宝冢纪念”决定──\n由谁成为故事的主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d086b0563427a2590df1afc88009dc48530100191b9288ddd1a1c702e6e31fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044427.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b6d2de3fec2ad93e8811931",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "安田纪念结束后・怀抱热情",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c9aec183731da8a07a1d004cd86da2de74e54b8a2fdaff129e30d475cf7a7d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044427.json",
