    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e61561508e28e37e39f7c8a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经历三后冠路线后参战的东商变革，\n压制众多实力坚强的赛马娘，\n漂亮地拿下了第一名。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a36c51011011c45f3f3d4e6fd37627e754d978675b0989427470ee7aa0c258d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044428.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
