    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d6a67c1cd5827977725f5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同期的赛马娘顺从被魔法激发的情绪，\n和川上公主一起跳过栅栏，\n降落在草地上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1719889c273e7b63848d805e856e026d884431d78167ca830d4ff612aaa247d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1044/storytimeline_501044429.json",
