    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a9ac321ff952846740f267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时，东商变革提议要和她们一决胜负。\n最后决定在“伊丽莎白女王杯”确认魔法的效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a230e8a6af85d13e3ddcbf067f2042d51b212e7a8559d4a4ce74a57a5b44582",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
